<title>USA: American Biomed catheter trial good so far.</title>
<headline>American Biomed catheter trial good so far.</headline>
<dateline>THE WOODLANDS, Texas 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>American BioMed Inc said Thursday that its prospective, randomized clinical trials comparing the immediate effectiveness of the company's Thrombectomy Catheter is now 65 percent complete and all cases have demonstrated initial technical success.</p>
<p>The company expects to complete the trials in 60 days and file for FDA 510K approval shortly thereafter.</p>
</text>
